{"resourceIdentifier":"3060","resourceName":"Wushan County MSW Landfill Site LFG Pollution Treatment and Comprehensive Utilization Project","description":"Wushan County MSW Landfill Site LFG pollution treatment and comprehensive utilization project (hereafter referred to as the project) is located at Wushan County MSW landfill site (hereafter referred to as Wushan landfill site), in Wushan County, Chongqing City, P.R. China. The project is constructed and operated by Wushan County BCCY Urban Environment Service Co., Ltd.\r\nWushan landfill site started collecting and handling waste at the 01/01/2022.\r\nThe project started to construct on 20/10/2021. The project has a total designed capacity 1MW (2*0.5MW) and combusts the LFG, which contains nearly 50% of methane, to generate electricity and export it to the Central China Power Grid (CCPG). Total electricity supplied to the grid in the crediting period will be 40,989MWh. VCUs will be claimed from the methane destroyed and the grid electricity displaced. The estimated average GHG emission reductions of the project is 24,770tCO2e and the total GHG emission reductions and removals are 247,700tCO2e during the fixed 10 years crediting period.\r\nScenario existing prior to the implementation of the project (the same as baseline scenario):\r\nLFG from Wushan landfill site is emitted to the atmosphere directly.\r\nEquivalent electricity generated by the project is supplied by the CCPG, which is dominated by fossil fuel based power plants.","location":{"latitude":31.500000,"longitude":109.500000},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-05-25","endExclusive":"2022-06-25","endInclusive":"2022-06-24"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3060"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Chongqing"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan BCCY Environmental Energy CO.,LTD."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan, China"},{"type":"string","value":"86 371 6552 1782"},{"type":"string","value":"lwang@bccynewpower.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Verification approval requested"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"24770"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Energy industries (renewable/non-renewable sources)"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-I.D.,AMS-III.G."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"LGAI Technological Center, S.A. (Applus+ Certification)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"12/07/2023"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/01/2022 - 31/12/2031"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=64559&IDKEY=f097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09nm23mrn87989026861","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-Wushan.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-04-07T00:59:02.58Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=64541&IDKEY=l0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9l89002039","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Wushan-VCS-Listing-Representation-Single-Representor.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-04-06T06:32:42.67Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=93794&IDKEY=u8723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq0f129341926","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-Wushan-clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-07-12T12:22:59.867Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/m